	(text_box "REV B - PCB / ASSEMBLY NOTES\n1. Pinout and decoupling corrected to ADuCM355 Rev C. Board: 120 x 80 mm, 4 layers.\n2. All capacitors fitted. JP1-JP4 stay OPEN during operation; R11 (0 ohm) must be fitted.\n3. Sensor sockets: 3 x Mill-Max 0548-0-15-15-21-27-10-0 per ES1, 1.0 mm finished PTH.\n   PCB top-view electrode order follows the mirrored manufacturer bottom-view drawing.\n4. VIN 4.0-5.5 V, nominal 5 V. All I2C, UART and debug signals are 3.3 V logic.\n5. U1/U2 require firmware. Configure 0x30/0x31 from address straps; ALERT must be open drain.\n6. Perform clean-air zero, certified-gas span calibration and temperature compensation.\n   This hardware prototype has not been bench-tested. See PCB_README.md."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 26 0)
		(size 250 34)
		(margins 1.3 1.3 1.3 1.3)
		(stroke
			(width 0.2)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "51ae428a-5b83-486f-946e-807510e89c75")
	)
	(text_box "DESIGN NOTES\nRTIA selection (ADuCM355 LPTIA, programmable 1k...512k):\n  ES1-AG1-200 : 40 nA/ppm, 200 ppm FS -> 8 uA FS. RTIA = 100k -> 0.80 V FS.\n                16-bit ADC over ~+/-0.9 V -> ~27 uV LSB -> 0.27 nA -> ~0.007 ppm/LSB.\n  ES1-AG1-10  : 40 nA/ppm, 10 ppm FS -> 400 nA FS. RTIA = 512k -> 0.205 V FS -> ~0.0013 ppm/LSB.\n  Keep RLOAD = 100 R (EC Sense recommended load resistor for the ES1 series).\nBias: VBIAS/VZERO 12-bit LPDACs, 0.2...2.4 V. 0 mV bias -> VBIAS = VZERO (typ. 1.1 V).\n      For biased gases set VBIAS = VZERO + Vbias_target.\nI2C: each ADuCM355 runs as an I2C target. Firmware reads its strap on P2.4 at boot and\n     selects 0x30 or 0x31, so one binary serves both devices.\nLayout: guard ring at VZERO potential around every SE net; no soldermask opening under\n     the sensor sockets; clean with no-clean flux only; keep SE traces < 15 mm; AGND and\n     DGND joined at one point under U1/U2; do not route I2C or SWD under the AFE section."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 312 0)
		(size 250 88)
		(margins 1.225 1.225 1.225 1.225)
		(stroke
			(width 0.2)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "aee204d5-25a7-4d07-aa01-9c12d9844d43")
	)
